@startuml UC-10 提交处方审核
actor 医生
boundary "处方接口" as PrescriptionController
control "处方应用服务" as PrescriptionAppService
control "处方状态机" as PrescriptionStateMachine
entity "处方仓储" as PrescriptionRepository
entity "药品查询端口" as DrugQueryPort
entity "流转记录仓储" as FlowRecordRepository
医生 -> PrescriptionController : 提交处方审核（版本号）
PrescriptionController -> PrescriptionAppService : 提交审核(处方编号, 医生编号, 版本)
PrescriptionAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 查询处方聚合
PrescriptionAppService -> DrugQueryPort : 查询启用药品
PrescriptionAppService -> PrescriptionStateMachine : 执行提交迁移
PrescriptionStateMachine --> PrescriptionAppService : 目标状态为待审核
PrescriptionAppService -> PrescriptionRepository : 按版本更新
alt 更新冲突
  PrescriptionAppService --> PrescriptionController : 40903
else 成功
  PrescriptionAppService -> FlowRecordRepository : 追加提交记录
  PrescriptionAppService --> PrescriptionController : prescription summary
end
@enduml
